msgid "HELP_TASKS"
msgstr ""
"You need to do tasks.\n"
"Some tasks require to come close to the subject of testing (812, partly "
"938).\n"
"Some tasks require to bring Class-D (080, 162, 173, 266, 522, 939, partly "
"938).\n"
"Some tasks require to bring object/item to special place (347, 914).\n"
"Some tasks require to come with special item (791).\n"
"Some tasks require to interact or use subject of testing (023, 067, 249).\n"
"Some tasks require to interact with item while having another item in "
"inventory (5270-2306)"

msgid "HELP_EVENTS"
msgstr ""
"Also the game has events.\n"
"There are only three events implemented right now - Chaos Insurgency "
"invasion and SCP-023 critical state.\n"
"For the first one, you need to call MTF (maybe more then one time), just "
"when they appear.\n"
"For SCP-023 - if you round took long (> 2 minutes), you need to go to "
"Maintenance Zone and go to SCP-023, replacing his \"eyes\" as soon, as "
"possible."

