msgid "TONEMAPPER_INFO"
msgstr ""
"Tonemappers change game appearance.\n"
"Linear does no postprocessing and is fastest to use.\n"
"Reinhardt tonemapper is slower, than linear one,\n"
"used to partly replicate SL Mimicry look.\n"
"Filmic tonemapper is slower, than Reinhardt one.\n"
"ACES tonemapper is slower, than Filmic one,\n"
"this is the tonemapper, used in SL Parabellum.\n"
"AGX tonemapper is relatively new, and is the slowest one.\n"
"---\n"
"Note, that Web version of the game supports only the first two\n"
"tonemappers because of performance issues."

